<title>UK: LB Schleswig Holstein sets $200 mln 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig Holstein sets $200 mln 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CIBC Wood Gundy and Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG HOLSTEIN</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    14.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.891   PAY DATE    14.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.7035   SPREAD	+9 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMAN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
